[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5761.35, "timestamp": "01:36:01", "text": "每次都要去取水。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5765.27, "timestamp": "01:36:05", "text": "只需要单程旅行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5767.669, "timestamp": "01:36:07", "text": "我这里也有纸巾。所以，如果像我一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5768.91, "timestamp": "01:36:08", "text": "弄得一团糟或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5771.43, "timestamp": "01:36:11", "text": "有些东西，我可以清理干净。我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5777.51, "timestamp": "01:36:17", "text": "纸巾。我的大部分人也都是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5779.43, "timestamp": "01:36:19", "text": "我喜欢吃的东西，比如我的蛋白质。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5781.11, "timestamp": "01:36:21", "text": "奶昔、我的蛋白粉，还有那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5783.11, "timestamp": "01:36:23", "text": "这里就这类东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5786.47, "timestamp": "01:36:26", "text": "我的包里也装着零食。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5789.27, "timestamp": "01:36:29", "text": "就像我旁边的一些饼干一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5793.189, "timestamp": "01:36:33", "text": "如果我半夜饿了，就吃这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5796.51, "timestamp": "01:36:36", "text": "我基本上有一家小店。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5799.59, "timestamp": "01:36:39", "text": "这里。就像有一次，我的姐姐，我的姐姐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5801.83, "timestamp": "01:36:41", "text": "她有一些朋友，她们都在我的圈子里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5804.35, "timestamp": "01:36:44", "text": "房间里，我姐姐说："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5806.95, "timestamp": "01:36:46", "text": "“哦，橙子，你有创可贴吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5808.95, "timestamp": "01:36:48", "text": "我就会说：“是啊，我确实有。”然后她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5810.79, "timestamp": "01:36:50", "text": "他又问我要了另一件事。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5812.79, "timestamp": "01:36:52", "text": "“是的，我同意。”然后她问，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5816.07, "timestamp": "01:36:56", "text": "呃，用来剃须。我心想，“是啊，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5818.27, "timestamp": "01:36:58", "text": "这样做。”她和她的朋友，她"}]